.TH KUMSHOT 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumshot \- screenshot tool for Wayland
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumshot
[\fB\-o\fR \fIfile\fR] [\fB\-s\fR \fIoutput\fR] [\fB\-a\fR] [\fB\-r\fR]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-o \fIfile\fR
Output path. Default: ~/Pictures/kumshot_TIMESTAMP.png
.TP
.B \-s \fIoutput\fR
Capture a specific output by name (e.g. DP-1).
.TP
.B \-a
Capture all outputs into a single composited image.
.TP
.B \-r
Interactively drag-select a region to capture. Opens a dimmed
layer-shell overlay on every output; click and drag to select,
release to capture, Escape to cancel.
.SH OUTPUT
Prints the saved file path to stdout.
